sevenplus (0.2.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Exact rational arithmetic, half-to-even display rounding.
  * Five built-in themes with inheritance; user themes in TOML.
  * Accessibility: screen-reader names, keyboard focus, high contrast.
  * Per-monitor DPI, window position memory, crash reports and logging.

